    "description": "GloryFit is a companion app for the smart watch Q18. This app works with the smart watch Q18 to record your exercise details, such as step counting, sleep, heart rate, etc.\r\nIn addition, GloryFit also supports SMS reminder, call reminder, SMS quick reply, APP reminder and other functions.\r\nObtain accessibility services to assist the App message reminder function, and push messages from other apps to the smart watch Q18.",
